    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28627" root="عرد" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَرِدٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَرْدٌ</span>, in two places. In the phrase
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَرَادٌ عَرِدٌ</span>, the latter word may be added to give
intensiveness to the signification, or it may be
used by poetic license for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَارِدٌ</span>. (TA.)

